                                "sense_id": "996c03a1-eacd-3321-8163-1d0e7576e365",
                                "text": "Master Lionel be hot-foot for Winchester, to drill recruities."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "28f05e7f-9129-432d-8551-5eedaf80515b",
                                "sense_id": "996c03a1-eacd-3321-8163-1d0e7576e365",
                                "text": "He will not tell the \"recruity\", the street Arab, or the Elmira inmate how he is managed. He will address himself to those who administer the moral capital of society – to teachers, clergymen, editors, law-makers, and judges, who wield the instruments of control […]"
                            },
