                                "sense_id": "996c03a1-eacd-3321-8163-1d0e7576e365",
                                "text": "2003, S. M. Stirling, David Drake, Conqueror\n\"Ye peon-witted dickehead recruity!\" the corporal said. \"Why ain't ye in t' fukkin' infantry? Ye want one a' them pigstickers up yer arse?\""
